WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.530
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.800 --> 00:06.840
I'm here to apologize.

3
00:08.440 --> 00:09.280
Apologize?

4
00:09.360 --> 00:10.720
You're not running away

5
00:11.560 --> 00:13.040
just because you fell for my brother, are you?

6
00:13.680 --> 00:14.440
P'Ing,

7
00:14.800 --> 00:16.000
we need to sort this out first.

8
00:17.840 --> 00:19.440
We're in public, you know.

9
00:23.920 --> 00:24.720
Yok.

10
00:26.000 --> 00:27.440
You said we'd watch the sunrise together, didn't you?

11
00:34.480 --> 00:35.520
P'Ing...

12
00:59.880 --> 01:00.960
Sweetie,

13
01:01.400 --> 01:02.560
you're burning up.

14
01:04.120 --> 01:05.200
Have you eaten yet?

15
01:07.080 --> 01:08.440
I'll go get your medicine.

16
01:08.720 --> 01:10.600
Eat something so you can take your meds, okay?

17
02:04.440 --> 02:05.240
P'Ing?

18
02:07.320 --> 02:08.720
What the hell is going on?

19
02:10.160 --> 02:11.320
Don't tell me...

20
02:13.720 --> 02:14.680
you've been holding me

21
02:14.720 --> 02:16.600
since we were rushed here.

22
02:18.920 --> 02:19.880
I haven't.

23
02:21.320 --> 02:24.680
Then why are you clinging to me like this?

24
02:24.760 --> 02:26.920
Is there a shortage of hospital beds?

25
02:27.520 --> 02:28.800
That's not it, either.

26
02:29.000 --> 02:30.120
I see.

27
02:30.880 --> 02:34.280
You must have just been waiting...

28
02:34.320 --> 02:36.240
for the chance to cuddle up with me in bed.

29
02:39.079 --> 02:40.040
P'Ing,

30
02:42.560 --> 02:44.120
about what I said yesterday...

31
02:44.600 --> 02:45.720
You mean about last night?

32
02:48.720 --> 02:50.600
What about it? I don't seem to remember.

33
02:54.680 --> 02:55.960
Are you going back on your word?

34
02:56.440 --> 02:57.600
What do you mean?

35
02:58.480 --> 02:59.520
I do remember.

36
03:01.160 --> 03:02.560
It's good that you're okay.

37
03:12.680 --> 03:13.960
Same goes for you.

38
03:17.320 --> 03:18.160
Fine.

39
03:19.560 --> 03:21.880
I'll marry into your family.

40
03:23.520 --> 03:24.360
As for you,

41
03:25.600 --> 03:27.280
you have to be my bottom, though.

42
03:30.040 --> 03:31.200
You wish.

43
03:36.680 --> 03:39.360
This is actually nice.

44
03:46.350 --> 03:47.910
[Mom]

45
03:51.680 --> 03:52.440
Hello, Mom.

46
03:52.480 --> 03:53.840
Why didn't you pick up my calls?

47
03:54.040 --> 03:55.840
I was calling you all night.

48
03:55.880 --> 03:58.040
I'm at the Samui project with P'Ing.

49
03:58.880 --> 04:00.440
My phone happened to break,

50
04:00.720 --> 04:02.480
and it was pouring last night,

51
04:03.040 --> 04:04.560
so I just got it repaired.

52
04:04.560 --> 04:07.040
You mean Koh Samui?

53
04:07.880 --> 04:08.600
The news said

54
04:08.600 --> 04:10.840
the storm hit earlier than forecasted.

55
04:11.720 --> 04:13.280
You're okay, right?

56
04:14.240 --> 04:15.360
I'm fine.

57
04:15.920 --> 04:17.519
But the site inspection

58
04:17.519 --> 04:19.839
might be delayed by a few days.

59
04:20.800 --> 04:21.839
I'll be here for a while.

60
04:22.120 --> 04:25.400
Can you make it home this Saturday?

61
04:26.320 --> 04:29.720
I don't think I can, Mom.

62
04:30.240 --> 04:31.720
You and Dad don't have to worry.

63
04:32.480 --> 04:33.960
I can take care of myself.

64
04:34.720 --> 04:37.440
Okay, dear. See you.

65
04:37.960 --> 04:38.680
See you, Mom.

66
04:51.120 --> 04:52.680
We're in a hospital, you know.

67
04:59.920 --> 05:02.840
I've never done it in a hospital before.

68
05:19.800 --> 05:21.600
Let me lock the door first.

69
05:23.160 --> 05:24.880
You've learned something, haven't you?

70
05:37.920 --> 05:38.840
P'Ing...

71
05:40.680 --> 05:41.760
Are you alright?

72
05:42.760 --> 05:43.960
I'm not that badly hurt.

73
05:44.280 --> 05:45.920
I'll be fine after resting for a few days.

74
05:46.159 --> 05:48.320
Someone told Dad about what happened last night,

75
05:48.880 --> 05:50.680
so he told me to bring you home.

76
05:50.880 --> 05:52.040
It's nothing serious.

77
05:52.320 --> 05:54.440
Then I'll stay here with you.

78
05:54.480 --> 05:55.240
No need.

79
05:55.640 --> 05:57.159
I don't need anyone watching over me.

80
05:57.840 --> 05:58.440
Look.

81
06:03.200 --> 06:04.720
I can manage on my own.

82
06:05.600 --> 06:07.240
Aren't you supposed to be studying for your exams?

83
06:07.440 --> 06:08.320
How can my exams

84
06:08.560 --> 06:10.720
matter more than your safety?

85
06:17.320 --> 06:19.920
Yok will also be here, after all.

86
06:26.600 --> 06:28.440
Why are you just standing there? Sit down.

87
06:32.640 --> 06:33.640
Does it hurt?

88
06:34.320 --> 06:36.320
No, it's just a few scratches.

89
06:36.760 --> 06:38.080
I just need some rest.

90
06:45.080 --> 06:45.800
Yok,

91
06:46.920 --> 06:48.680
I want to talk to my brother in private.

92
06:50.760 --> 06:51.920
Excuse me.

93
06:53.480 --> 06:54.720
There you are.

94
06:55.040 --> 06:57.080
I was looking for you.

95
06:57.120 --> 06:57.840
Go back to your room

96
06:57.880 --> 07:00.160
and finish your IV drip, sir.

97
07:07.480 --> 07:08.240
Go on.

98
07:17.000 --> 07:18.160
Does it hurt a lot?

99
09:29.960 --> 09:30.600
Itt.

100
09:32.640 --> 09:33.200
Yok.

101
09:34.640 --> 09:36.320
You wanted to resign

102
09:36.560 --> 09:38.000
because of my brother, right?

103
09:43.680 --> 09:45.040
You're in love with him, aren't you?

104
09:49.400 --> 09:50.480
I'm sorry.

105
09:52.720 --> 09:53.480
Yok,

106
09:54.080 --> 09:55.400
you told me to fight

107
09:55.400 --> 09:56.680
and take my revenge.

108
09:56.960 --> 09:58.440
You got me to where I am now,

109
09:58.600 --> 10:00.840
but what you've done makes me feel like

110
10:00.880 --> 10:03.040
I've been betrayed by my best friend.

111
10:08.880 --> 10:10.800
I know I'm to blame for what happened,

112
10:10.800 --> 10:11.440
but...

113
10:12.720 --> 10:14.920
I don't think P'Ing is that bad.

114
10:15.360 --> 10:16.520
If you can,

115
10:17.400 --> 10:19.200
-you should talk to him... -About what?

116
10:19.800 --> 10:20.600
How?

117
10:21.480 --> 10:23.080
Are you not going to America anymore?

118
10:23.360 --> 10:24.840
I haven't signed the contract yet.

119
10:25.280 --> 10:26.200
There's still time.

120
10:29.160 --> 10:31.280
Maybe I'm jealous of you, Yok.

121
10:33.040 --> 10:34.200
P'Ing braved the storm to save you

122
10:34.200 --> 10:35.680
without caring about his own life.

123
10:36.600 --> 10:37.600
But you know

124
10:37.600 --> 10:38.720
what he's done to me.

125
10:40.560 --> 10:42.840
If he finds out I was plotting against him,

126
10:43.600 --> 10:45.160
do you think he'll spare me?

127
10:51.840 --> 10:53.040
Itt, hey...

128
10:53.800 --> 10:54.520
Itt.

129
10:55.040 --> 10:57.280
That money doesn't mean anything to him,

130
10:58.320 --> 11:00.880
but it's the only way out for me and my mom.

131
11:02.520 --> 11:04.200
And you gave me your word.

132
11:04.640 --> 11:05.720
In all these years,

133
11:05.720 --> 11:07.640
I've only ever asked you for one thing.

134
11:08.560 --> 11:09.840
Just one thing.

135
11:21.600 --> 11:22.320
Itt,

136
11:24.160 --> 11:25.000
I think...

137
11:28.040 --> 11:29.720
I'd better quit.

138
11:38.400 --> 11:40.080
I don't want to hurt him anymore.

139
11:43.960 --> 11:45.560
About the project in Pattaya,

140
11:46.360 --> 11:47.520
I'll transfer everything to you.

141
11:48.520 --> 11:49.800
I won't stand in your way,

142
11:49.880 --> 11:51.600
and I'll keep it a secret.

143
11:52.840 --> 11:54.680
But you have to promise me...

144
11:55.320 --> 11:56.800
that once you get the money,

145
11:58.080 --> 11:58.960
you'll stop.

146
12:09.600 --> 12:11.520
I knew you wouldn't change your mind.

147
12:13.440 --> 12:15.040
You don't have to resign from the company.

148
12:16.960 --> 12:18.800
I'll use my own company from now on.

149
12:19.400 --> 12:20.720
Think of it as a keepsake.

150
12:24.480 --> 12:26.440
I won't get you into any more trouble.

151
12:31.960 --> 12:32.640
Itt...

152
12:37.400 --> 12:39.360
Are we still friends?

153
12:43.000 --> 12:44.000
Of course.

154
12:45.240 --> 12:46.560
We'll always be friends.

155
12:49.040 --> 12:51.040
What are you going to do about P'Ing?

156
12:53.760 --> 12:55.200
I know him better than anyone.

157
12:56.760 --> 12:57.880
My brother...

158
12:58.240 --> 12:59.920
hates nothing more than being lied to.

159
13:01.360 --> 13:03.520
The second you helped me,

160
13:03.560 --> 13:04.920
you'd already betrayed him.

161
13:39.400 --> 13:40.560
Excuse me.

162
13:41.160 --> 13:42.520
The patient has just fallen asleep.

163
13:42.520 --> 13:44.960
Please don't disturb his rest right now.

164
13:45.880 --> 13:46.680
Okay.

165
14:16.800 --> 14:17.840
What's up, Young Master?

166
14:18.520 --> 14:19.280
Where are you?

167
14:19.320 --> 14:20.120
Are you bored?

168
14:20.480 --> 14:22.840
Or did you miss me?

169
14:23.280 --> 14:24.280
Are you free tonight?

170
14:26.240 --> 14:27.600
Are you asking me out?

171
14:28.000 --> 14:29.600
That's too bad, though.

172
14:29.960 --> 14:32.360
I already have a client to take care of.

173
14:32.840 --> 14:33.880
Name your price.

174
14:34.280 --> 14:35.800
From now on, you're on my dime,

175
14:36.360 --> 14:37.720
but the condition is...

176
14:38.120 --> 14:39.760
you can't see any other clients.

177
14:40.480 --> 14:40.960
And...

178
15:12.640 --> 15:13.480
You little Young Master.

179
15:17.840 --> 15:20.360
Remember to pay me when you wake up.

180
15:22.280 --> 15:23.720
You've got a good-looking face.

181
15:25.600 --> 15:26.640
You're loaded, too.

182
15:31.480 --> 15:33.520
What the hell is bothering you so much?

183
15:56.600 --> 15:57.800
Maybe you actually...

184
15:58.440 --> 15:59.920
missed me.

185
16:33.680 --> 16:34.640
Where am I?

186
16:45.840 --> 16:47.560
Eat it while it's still hot.

187
16:55.240 --> 16:58.320
Last night, you bought me off another client

188
16:58.680 --> 16:59.360
and got trashed.

189
16:59.360 --> 17:00.400
I had to carry you back.

190
17:00.600 --> 17:02.720
P.S. You still owe me

191
17:02.720 --> 17:04.560
for the money I lost out on last night.

192
17:04.560 --> 17:05.520
I'll let you run a tab for now.

193
17:10.760 --> 17:12.530
[From now on, I'm your only client.]

194
17:12.560 --> 17:13.990
[If you can't do that, return it to me.]

195
17:21.510 --> 17:23.700
[Whenever you miss me, that's when I get off work.]

196
17:23.730 --> 17:25.290
[I'm coming, then.]

197
17:25.319 --> 17:27.540
[My little caterpillar's in a hurry, huh?]

198
17:27.569 --> 17:28.930
[Caterpillar?]

199
17:28.950 --> 17:31.440
[I'm not going anywhere.]

200
17:54.040 --> 17:56.200
What the fuck?

201
17:57.160 --> 17:59.360
Is this my welcome back?

202
17:59.920 --> 18:01.880
Welcome back, sir.

203
18:01.920 --> 18:03.800
This is how much we've missed you

204
18:03.840 --> 18:06.160
while you were away.

205
18:09.000 --> 18:10.360
It's been tough for you, Secretary Piang.

206
18:11.560 --> 18:12.960
I'll give you five...

207
18:16.200 --> 18:17.280
Five?

208
18:18.240 --> 18:19.320
I'll give you triple your OT rate.

209
18:21.640 --> 18:24.040
But weren't you supposed to be sick?

210
18:24.040 --> 18:25.560
It looks like...

211
18:25.560 --> 18:28.560
you're much brighter than before.

212
18:28.640 --> 18:31.200
Oh, of course.

213
18:31.680 --> 18:33.920
When something good happens to you,

214
18:34.760 --> 18:36.440
it's natural to look radiant.

215
18:37.800 --> 18:41.080
Looks like having a life partner...

216
18:41.120 --> 18:42.720
I mean, a good business partner...

217
18:42.720 --> 18:46.720
makes work a lot more pleasant and productive.

218
18:47.600 --> 18:48.800
Since you said that,

219
18:49.320 --> 18:50.880
I'll cut it from triple to double.

220
18:52.840 --> 18:54.240
You do look brighter,

221
18:54.240 --> 18:55.920
-after all. -Here, Secretary Piang.

222
18:56.040 --> 18:57.280
Please schedule a meeting right away.

223
18:57.320 --> 18:59.680
The local leaders in Pattaya

224
18:59.720 --> 19:00.520
have already agreed.

225
19:00.560 --> 19:01.680
We only need one set of documents

226
19:01.720 --> 19:03.760
from Green Agriculture

227
19:03.800 --> 19:06.600
to start the project approval process.

228
19:06.640 --> 19:08.440
We'll discuss the details in the meeting.

229
19:08.480 --> 19:10.080
Understood. I'll get right on it.

230
19:11.440 --> 19:12.680
Make sure to submit that...

231
19:13.440 --> 19:13.840
Yes?

232
19:13.880 --> 19:15.960
You're getting five times the OT.

233
19:16.440 --> 19:19.320
Whoa, okay. Thank you, sir.

234
20:00.720 --> 20:02.080
Thank you.

235
20:07.240 --> 20:08.640
P'Ing,

236
20:08.760 --> 20:09.920
I missed you.

237
20:09.960 --> 20:10.760
What?

238
20:11.080 --> 20:12.880
Weren't you just here to deliver dinner?

239
20:21.560 --> 20:22.480
Hold on.

240
20:22.840 --> 20:23.920
Close the door first.

241
20:24.120 --> 20:24.920
Hey.

242
20:38.560 --> 20:39.320
Hey,

243
20:39.840 --> 20:41.520
it'll turn into mush if you keep doing that.

244
20:44.120 --> 20:44.960
I'm sorry.

245
20:48.080 --> 20:49.080
What are you sorry for?

246
20:50.560 --> 20:51.440
Alright.

247
20:53.520 --> 20:54.480
Just say it.

248
21:02.280 --> 21:05.360
It's about that tryout at the boxing gym.

249
21:06.800 --> 21:07.920
I passed.

250
21:08.560 --> 21:10.240
They want to sign me to a contract

251
21:11.920 --> 21:13.760
and have me train in America.

252
21:23.520 --> 21:24.520
Are you serious?

253
21:25.040 --> 21:25.800
Wow.

254
21:26.400 --> 21:28.120
You're amazing, you know that?

255
21:28.480 --> 21:29.440
It's America.

256
21:29.480 --> 21:30.840
You must be incredible.

257
21:31.040 --> 21:31.920
Let me give you a reward.

258
21:36.040 --> 21:36.960
What's wrong?

259
21:38.520 --> 21:40.160
What's with that face?

260
21:40.760 --> 21:41.520
Hey.

261
21:41.920 --> 21:44.080
You thought I wouldn't let you go, right?

262
21:46.640 --> 21:47.680
Fine, I'll admit

263
21:47.680 --> 21:50.920
that I wanted to keep you chained to my side.

264
21:51.960 --> 21:53.080
But not anymore.

265
21:53.480 --> 21:54.440
You know why?

266
21:55.400 --> 21:58.440
Because your heart belongs to me now.

267
21:58.440 --> 22:00.880
No matter where in the world you go,

268
22:01.040 --> 22:02.760
you'll still be thinking of me.

269
22:08.360 --> 22:09.000
Oh...

270
22:10.840 --> 22:12.440
I don't want to go anymore.

271
22:13.040 --> 22:13.920
Why not?

272
22:14.840 --> 22:15.640
Hey.

273
22:16.040 --> 22:16.600
Look.

274
22:18.440 --> 22:19.720
You trained your heart out for this.

275
22:19.760 --> 22:21.040
Why are you backing out now?

276
22:22.560 --> 22:23.920
I see.

277
22:24.600 --> 22:26.320
Because I'm too hot, right?

278
22:26.720 --> 22:28.920
No wonder you can't keep your mouth off my neck.

279
22:29.320 --> 22:29.880
Is that it?

280
22:30.720 --> 22:31.520
Why?

281
22:31.720 --> 22:33.440
Why give up after so much hard work?

282
22:34.680 --> 22:36.320
Hey, be honest with me.

283
22:38.400 --> 22:40.280
Do you feel a rush when you're in the ring?

284
22:41.560 --> 22:42.240
I do.

285
22:42.280 --> 22:43.040
There you go.

286
22:43.920 --> 22:45.680
If you feel that rush, give it everything you've got.

287
22:45.720 --> 22:47.440
Do you have any idea how rare it is...

288
22:48.640 --> 22:50.480
to find something that gives you that rush?

289
22:50.880 --> 22:52.040
It's hard to come by.

290
22:52.280 --> 22:53.200
You think I can't afford

291
22:53.240 --> 22:54.680
a ticket to America

292
22:54.680 --> 22:56.200
to visit you?

293
22:58.520 --> 23:00.320
I could book a flight right now if I wanted to.

294
23:02.400 --> 23:03.320
But...

295
23:04.280 --> 23:06.520
I'm not sure if my dad will let me go.

296
23:08.120 --> 23:08.760
He wants me

297
23:08.760 --> 23:10.440
to help my brother with the family business.

298
23:10.440 --> 23:11.200
And?

299
23:11.880 --> 23:13.640
Is that business really that important?

300
23:13.680 --> 23:15.520
Is it more important than your dream?

301
23:15.800 --> 23:17.280
Just do both.

302
23:17.360 --> 23:18.120
Simple as that.

303
23:18.560 --> 23:20.160
Do what you have to do, then tell him later.

304
23:20.280 --> 23:21.480
As for keeping it a secret,

305
23:22.440 --> 23:23.840
you can count on me.

306
23:28.680 --> 23:29.760
Well...

307
23:31.240 --> 23:32.400
Will you wait for me?

308
23:32.960 --> 23:34.560
You really think I will?

309
23:36.080 --> 23:37.160
I'd definitely...

310
23:37.920 --> 23:40.040
be booking the first flight out to see you

311
23:40.080 --> 23:42.120
in America.

312
23:42.280 --> 23:43.160
Listen to me.

313
23:43.160 --> 23:44.680
If I fly all that way to America

314
23:44.680 --> 23:46.240
and you haven't won a single title,

315
23:46.280 --> 23:48.240
I'm going to jump-kick you right in the face.

316
23:48.280 --> 23:50.520
It's a long flight. Got it?

317
23:55.280 --> 23:56.120
P'Ing...

318
23:57.000 --> 23:57.920
What if...

319
23:58.680 --> 24:00.720
I'm not the person you think I am?

320
24:01.040 --> 24:01.640
What would you do?

321
24:01.680 --> 24:03.160
Jeez, what's with you today?

322
24:03.200 --> 24:04.440
Why so dramatic?

323
24:04.920 --> 24:06.840
Are you scamming me out of my money?

324
24:07.120 --> 24:09.040
Or are you trying to steal my heart?

325
24:10.440 --> 24:12.280
I don't know if you realize, but...

326
24:12.320 --> 24:14.360
I've already stolen yours.

327
24:18.280 --> 24:19.360
Listen to me.

328
24:21.280 --> 24:22.320
You know,

329
24:24.160 --> 24:25.320
when I choose someone,

330
24:27.720 --> 24:28.840
they're bound to be the best.

331
24:33.720 --> 24:34.560
Right.

332
24:38.440 --> 24:40.120
Oh, still worried?

333
24:50.680 --> 24:51.520
Come here.

334
24:52.320 --> 24:53.680
Come on.

335
24:54.280 --> 24:55.360
Get over here.

336
24:55.400 --> 24:57.200
Look at you, acting like a clingy bottom.

337
24:57.240 --> 24:59.080
What was all that tough talk for?

338
24:59.120 --> 25:00.920
Come on, just turn around already.

339
25:00.920 --> 25:01.880
I'm telling you.

340
25:01.920 --> 25:03.600
Just turn around, and that's it.

341
25:03.640 --> 25:05.720
Then everything will be just fine.

342
25:05.760 --> 25:06.200
No.

343
25:06.240 --> 25:08.240
Where is all this strength coming from?

344
25:09.480 --> 25:11.200
We just did it. You want another round already?

345
25:11.320 --> 25:13.200
Turn around. I won't this time.

346
25:13.520 --> 25:14.320
I said I'm not turning.

347
25:14.360 --> 25:15.560
You need to turn around, you...

348
25:33.560 --> 25:34.560
Let's go inside.

349
25:44.680 --> 25:46.280
When do you leave for training in America?

350
25:47.080 --> 25:48.280
September 15th.

351
25:54.720 --> 25:56.080
Consider yourself officially taken.

352
25:56.840 --> 25:57.800
From now on,

353
25:58.160 --> 26:00.280
you're eating out of my hand.

354
26:01.080 --> 26:02.480
I'm not letting you go anywhere.

355
26:04.720 --> 26:05.440
Okay.

356
26:20.280 --> 26:21.200
I used to think

357
26:21.200 --> 26:23.720
that living alone was the ultimate freedom,

358
26:24.080 --> 26:26.160
but seeing you moving in like this...

359
26:26.200 --> 26:28.440
I don't know why, but it makes me feel so happy.

360
26:28.480 --> 26:30.560
Can't you stay for more than just the weekends?

361
26:30.840 --> 26:33.000
Why not stay every day?

362
26:33.680 --> 26:35.280
Give you an inch, and you take a mile, huh?

363
26:49.210 --> 26:50.520
[There's food in the fridge. Microwave it first.]

364
26:50.560 --> 26:52.000
Where should I put my things?

365
26:52.200 --> 26:53.120
Right here.

366
26:53.440 --> 26:54.360
This is your spot.

367
26:57.720 --> 26:58.920
You have those, too?

368
26:58.920 --> 26:59.960
For dusting, you know.

369
27:00.000 --> 27:01.160
Is this all you have?

370
27:01.440 --> 27:02.880
I don't have as much stuff as you.

371
27:03.080 --> 27:03.880
Hey.

372
27:04.400 --> 27:05.520
Kiddo.

373
27:06.360 --> 27:08.040
Let me tell you something.

374
27:08.320 --> 27:10.440
My things aren't just my stuff, you know.

375
27:11.320 --> 27:12.440
They're my taste.

376
27:17.060 --> 27:19.220
[No classes tomorrow. Wanna hit the supermarket?]

377
27:21.490 --> 27:23.020
[Tonight, you're going to be my bottom.]

378
27:23.040 --> 27:24.160
[In your dreams.]

379
27:27.360 --> 27:28.280
P'Ing,

380
27:28.400 --> 27:30.280
stay still. Where's the key?

381
27:30.320 --> 27:31.320
In the pocket.

382
27:31.600 --> 27:33.160
-Pocket? -Yeah.

383
27:34.040 --> 27:35.320
Lower.

384
27:35.680 --> 27:36.920
Lower.

385
27:37.320 --> 27:38.760
Oh, you got it.

386
27:40.200 --> 27:41.520
Here it is.

387
27:44.920 --> 27:46.320
Stay still, P'Ing.

388
27:47.040 --> 27:48.200
Yok,

389
27:48.200 --> 27:49.200
give me a kiss.

390
27:54.960 --> 27:56.280
Yok.

391
27:57.120 --> 27:58.320
Do you want to sleep outside tonight?

392
28:12.720 --> 28:14.000
Now that's more like it.

393
28:14.040 --> 28:14.960
P'Ing...

394
28:15.840 --> 28:17.600
There's still more space.

395
28:18.200 --> 28:19.280
Come here.

396
28:21.280 --> 28:22.920
You're getting stretched tonight.

397
28:30.080 --> 28:31.720
A new healthy dish for you.

398
28:31.720 --> 28:33.040
Give it a taste.

399
28:41.120 --> 28:42.640
It's spicy chicken wing soup,

400
28:42.640 --> 28:44.800
but it's stuffed with chilies.

401
28:46.080 --> 28:47.000
Is it good?

402
28:48.920 --> 28:50.280
Wanna know how good it is?

403
28:50.320 --> 28:50.960
Get over here.

404
28:51.000 --> 28:52.200
Feel the spice.

405
28:52.240 --> 28:53.400
Come here.

406
28:55.600 --> 28:56.400
Is it spicy?

407
28:56.440 --> 28:57.080
Is it hot?

408
28:57.650 --> 28:58.670
[Secret Recipe for Shrimp Porridge]

409
28:58.700 --> 29:00.220
[Main ingredients: Shrimp, rice]

410
29:33.280 --> 29:34.680
This food here is pretty good.

411
29:35.000 --> 29:35.800
Yeah.

412
29:37.160 --> 29:38.120
So in love, huh?

413
29:41.120 --> 29:42.000
Mm.

414
29:44.680 --> 29:46.280
Pineapple. My favorite.

415
29:52.280 --> 29:53.360
Why aren't you picking up?

416
29:54.720 --> 29:55.480
Oh.

417
29:56.920 --> 29:58.520
It's just a telemarketer.

418
29:59.480 --> 30:00.320
It's nothing.

419
30:03.000 --> 30:05.160
Does the telemarketer's name happen to be Jelly?

420
30:05.200 --> 30:06.280
Jelly Bear.

421
30:09.440 --> 30:10.640
Okay, you win.

422
30:10.840 --> 30:12.080
Since we started seeing each other again,

423
30:12.080 --> 30:13.440
I haven't contacted him once.

424
30:13.440 --> 30:15.320
I haven't even said anything, P'Ing.

425
30:25.440 --> 30:27.680
I'll have Vince take care of it,

426
30:27.680 --> 30:29.840
and he'll never contact me again.

427
30:32.640 --> 30:33.440
Are you jealous?

428
30:34.960 --> 30:37.640
Is this what you look like when you're jealous?

429
30:39.120 --> 30:39.920
Jealous, aren't you?

430
30:40.320 --> 30:41.080
You jealous?

431
30:41.320 --> 30:42.720
-P'Ing. -What?

432
30:42.840 --> 30:43.920
There are people around.

433
30:43.920 --> 30:44.800
Just eat.

434
30:48.200 --> 30:49.320
Eat a lot, okay?

435
30:50.440 --> 30:51.400
So you'll have some energy.

436
30:52.640 --> 30:53.640
For what?

437
30:53.680 --> 30:56.280
Just in case you get hungry again after we leave.

438
31:00.000 --> 31:01.240
Aren't you going to eat?

439
31:02.240 --> 31:03.040
I am.

440
31:03.840 --> 31:04.920
The food?

441
31:05.440 --> 31:06.400
No, you.

442
31:06.760 --> 31:07.640
Tonight.

443
31:07.800 --> 31:09.920
The interior construction

444
31:09.960 --> 31:11.760
is now 85 percent complete.

445
31:11.840 --> 31:13.080
We need to finalize

446
31:13.080 --> 31:14.520
the interior design style

447
31:14.560 --> 31:16.760
and the core concept of the project first.

448
31:18.120 --> 31:19.920
Regarding the style and the ideas,

449
31:21.840 --> 31:22.880
why don't you prove yourself?

450
31:22.920 --> 31:24.800
Tell me what you think.

451
31:30.160 --> 31:32.000
I think a smart theme

452
31:32.040 --> 31:34.680
or something futuristic would be quite interesting.

453
31:34.680 --> 31:37.400
A smart or futuristic concept?

454
31:37.440 --> 31:39.560
Those concepts have been used for plenty of projects.

455
31:39.720 --> 31:41.080
This project we're working on

456
31:41.120 --> 31:42.880
is not just any ordinary project.

457
31:43.120 --> 31:46.320
It needs to have soul, be captivating,

458
31:47.360 --> 31:48.560
and feel warm.

459
31:50.120 --> 31:52.280
For example, the word...

460
31:53.280 --> 31:54.080
-Home. -Home.

461
32:07.320 --> 32:08.160
Mr. Ing,

462
32:08.560 --> 32:09.680
something urgent came up.

463
32:10.400 --> 32:11.520
Come in.

464
32:15.920 --> 32:16.720
What is it?

465
32:17.200 --> 32:19.960
Green Agriculture just informed us

466
32:20.080 --> 32:21.520
they are terminating the partnership.

467
32:22.600 --> 32:23.560
What's their reason?

468
32:24.560 --> 32:25.440
They only stated

469
32:25.440 --> 32:27.080
that it's due to a change in corporate strategy,

470
32:27.120 --> 32:29.160
and they no longer wish to pursue this business direction.

471
32:29.280 --> 32:30.400
Dammit.

472
32:30.880 --> 32:32.560
Do they think I'm some kind of joke?

473
32:33.960 --> 32:35.600
Jeez, they hung up on me.

474
32:42.440 --> 32:43.800
Hello, Director Pha-nu.

475
32:43.800 --> 32:46.480
I'm calling about Green Agriculture.

476
32:46.520 --> 32:48.280
Do you know if there's any problem?

477
32:51.480 --> 32:52.160
I see.

478
32:53.360 --> 32:54.360
Understood.

479
32:54.960 --> 32:56.920
Please let me know if there are any updates.

480
32:58.200 --> 32:59.320
Dammit.

481
33:00.280 --> 33:02.400
Does the couple have any idea

482
33:02.440 --> 33:04.720
how much we spent to acquire this land?

483
33:05.640 --> 33:07.840
What should we do next, P'Ing?

484
33:08.320 --> 33:10.520
Get them in here to talk to me.

485
33:11.560 --> 33:12.440
-Will do. -Jeez.

486
33:15.400 --> 33:16.200
Come in.

487
33:22.440 --> 33:23.560
What happened?

488
33:28.040 --> 33:30.040
Green Agriculture pulled out of the project.

489
33:37.400 --> 33:38.880
So suddenly?

490
33:39.440 --> 33:41.560
But there's some good news.

491
33:41.840 --> 33:43.760
Regarding the land in Phuket we discussed earlier,

492
33:43.800 --> 33:45.440
the survey team has already sent the documents.

493
33:45.520 --> 33:47.920
They say it's a large plot in an excellent location.

494
33:48.320 --> 33:49.440
The government is also showing interest

495
33:49.440 --> 33:50.880
since it's a very promising project.

496
33:52.400 --> 33:53.320
Here it is.

497
33:54.200 --> 33:55.120
Right.

498
33:55.920 --> 33:57.400
At least there's some good news.

499
33:57.960 --> 33:59.120
Contact this team immediately

500
33:59.160 --> 34:00.720
and have our team survey the site.

501
34:00.760 --> 34:01.520
Understood.

502
34:03.720 --> 34:04.560
Mr. Ing,

503
34:05.600 --> 34:06.920
I'd like to go with Itt as well.

504
34:06.920 --> 34:07.640
No need.

505
34:11.239 --> 34:12.880
I want you to look after...

506
34:15.320 --> 34:16.280
our home.

507
34:19.560 --> 34:20.360
What?

508
34:21.520 --> 34:22.800
Isn't it already settled

509
34:22.840 --> 34:24.600
that you'd be in charge of this project?

510
34:31.600 --> 34:32.360
Okay.

511
34:32.920 --> 34:34.719
I'll follow up on it as quickly as I can.

512
34:36.000 --> 34:36.639
Mm.

513
34:38.719 --> 34:40.280
Anything else?

514
34:40.679 --> 34:42.760
Oh, that's all.

515
34:42.800 --> 34:43.840
Then go.

516
34:59.000 --> 35:02.360
Ugh, it's just one thing after another.

517
35:07.640 --> 35:08.880
Do you see...

518
35:09.480 --> 35:13.280
just how difficult it is to do business?

519
35:13.440 --> 35:14.640
Before one job is even finished,

520
35:14.680 --> 35:16.680
another one runs into problems.

521
35:21.040 --> 35:24.600
hat's how hard it is to earn money

522
35:38.440 --> 35:40.000
As for the Pattaya project,

523
35:40.040 --> 35:41.200
don't tell your brother just yet.

524
35:41.920 --> 35:43.200
Wait until the director informs him first.

525
35:43.240 --> 35:44.280
Understood.

526
35:49.120 --> 35:50.040
P'Ing?

527
35:50.440 --> 35:51.440
Is that Pite?

528
35:52.880 --> 35:53.640
Hey, Pite.

529
35:53.640 --> 35:54.160
Watch out.

530
35:54.200 --> 35:56.560
Where do you think you're going? Come here, you idiot.

531
35:57.680 --> 35:58.720
Calm down.

532
35:58.760 --> 36:00.920
-That jerk. -Please calm down.

533
36:01.560 --> 36:02.880
You're running away from me?

534
36:03.200 --> 36:03.840
Fine.

535
36:05.000 --> 36:06.040
You'll see what's coming to you.

536
36:12.640 --> 36:13.400
Hello.

537
36:13.920 --> 36:16.160
Find out where Pite is staying.

538
36:17.000 --> 36:17.720
Yeah.

539
36:18.200 --> 36:19.560
And ask the military

540
36:19.560 --> 36:21.680
if they're still accepting volunteer recruits.

541
36:21.800 --> 36:23.000
I'm sending him into the army.

542
36:24.040 --> 36:24.800
Okay.

543
36:25.360 --> 36:26.640
Send him as far away as possible.

544
36:27.440 --> 36:28.240
Make it happen.

545
36:32.600 --> 36:34.160
You're sending him to the military?

546
36:35.080 --> 36:35.920
Just look at him.

547
36:36.120 --> 36:37.880
All he does is cause more trouble.

548
36:38.120 --> 36:39.600
I can't clean up after him anymore.

549
36:42.640 --> 36:44.680
I thought you'd have someone beat him up.

550
36:46.520 --> 36:48.000
He's still my cousin.

551
36:50.920 --> 36:52.160
If I don't straighten him out now,

552
36:52.200 --> 36:53.760
he'll be ruined for life.

553
36:55.880 --> 36:56.880
We're going to have a blast.

554
36:56.880 --> 36:59.280
Don't come crying back to me, you little jerk.

555
36:59.960 --> 37:00.920
Take it easy.

556
37:05.080 --> 37:05.800
Yok.

557
37:17.600 --> 37:18.720
What's this?

558
37:20.880 --> 37:22.320
Open it and see for yourself.

559
37:48.680 --> 37:49.480
What?

560
37:50.320 --> 37:52.360
You looked so shocked at first.

561
37:53.480 --> 37:54.880
Thought it was a ring, huh?

562
37:57.640 --> 37:59.960
I was just gonna give you the key,

563
38:00.000 --> 38:01.880
but that didn't feel grand enough,

564
38:01.880 --> 38:04.840
so I got you a box to go with it.

565
38:04.880 --> 38:06.160
It's more fitting for someone of my status.

566
38:08.600 --> 38:09.680
I know that right now,

567
38:09.720 --> 38:10.760
it might be impossible

568
38:10.800 --> 38:12.440
for you to move into my house,

569
38:12.840 --> 38:14.400
but you've got the key now.

570
38:15.120 --> 38:17.480
Just think of this place as your home.

571
38:18.960 --> 38:20.680
You're always welcome here.

572
38:23.880 --> 38:25.280
Thank you, P'Ing.

573
38:29.280 --> 38:32.320
I'll hire someone to scrub the pool clean

574
38:32.360 --> 38:33.560
and make the water

575
38:33.600 --> 38:35.520
crystal clear. How's that?

576
38:36.440 --> 38:38.520
Then we can have an underwater date.

577
38:39.800 --> 38:41.240
I have to go home today.

578
38:41.280 --> 38:42.840
Then go ahead.

579
38:43.840 --> 38:45.440
I wouldn't want you neglecting your duties.

580
38:47.640 --> 38:51.240
How about the day after tomorrow?

581
38:52.040 --> 38:52.800
Alright.

582
38:53.360 --> 38:56.600
I'll pick out some sexy swimwear,

583
38:57.320 --> 38:59.120
but I doubt I'll be wearing it for very long

584
38:59.160 --> 39:01.680
'cause you'll definitely be stripping me bare.

585
39:01.720 --> 39:03.400
If you say one more word,

586
39:04.880 --> 39:06.160
I'm not going home.

587
39:13.960 --> 39:15.120
I'm off.

588
39:20.960 --> 39:25.320
Should I go with leopard print or cherry blossoms?

589
39:29.560 --> 39:31.000
Wait, Yok.

590
39:33.960 --> 39:35.840
If I gave you a ring, would you take it?

591
39:38.480 --> 39:39.720
What did you just say?

592
39:45.720 --> 39:46.440
Nothing.

593
39:46.840 --> 39:48.360
Just telling you to get home safe.

594
39:50.000 --> 39:50.960
Bye.

595
40:10.120 --> 40:11.160
But there's some good news.

596
40:11.600 --> 40:13.440
Regarding the land in Phuket we discussed earlier,

597
40:13.480 --> 40:15.200
the survey team has already sent the documents.

598
40:15.240 --> 40:17.640
They say it's a large plot in an excellent location.

599
40:17.680 --> 40:18.800
The government is also showing interest

600
40:18.800 --> 40:20.240
since it's a very promising project.

601
40:31.200 --> 40:32.240
Hello, Yok?

602
40:32.600 --> 40:33.640
Hello, P'Phet.

603
40:34.200 --> 40:36.160
Could you put me in touch with Director Phadung

604
40:36.160 --> 40:38.760
from the Phuket Development Department?

605
40:38.920 --> 40:41.200
Director Phadung? Right now?

606
40:42.360 --> 40:43.360
I have some questions

607
40:43.360 --> 40:44.760
about the project.

608
40:45.720 --> 40:47.720
Sure, I'll send you his number.

609
40:47.880 --> 40:48.680
Thank you.

610
40:55.160 --> 40:57.960
Itt, I hope it's not you.

611
41:06.400 --> 41:07.920
I thought this project should've been

612
41:07.920 --> 41:10.240
a perfect wrap-up before you left for America.

613
41:10.280 --> 41:11.640
Dammit.

614
41:11.720 --> 41:12.840
We've been played for fools.

615
41:12.880 --> 41:13.880
You told me

616
41:13.880 --> 41:15.560
that there was no way you'd ever be into guys.

617
41:16.520 --> 41:18.040
I admit...

618
41:18.080 --> 41:19.400
that I act like a tyrant

619
41:19.440 --> 41:20.400
and have a nasty temper,

620
41:20.440 --> 41:22.000
but I've never tried to hurt anyone.

621
41:22.040 --> 41:24.200
You think you can just play me for a fool?

622
41:25.040 --> 41:26.280
You wanna die that badly?

623
41:27.640 --> 41:28.760
Okay, maybe a little bit.

624
41:30.360 --> 41:32.080
Every time I ask you something, you know nothing.

625
41:32.080 --> 41:33.200
Dammit.

626
41:33.960 --> 41:35.200
Pite, start talking.

627
41:35.240 --> 41:36.680
Hey, P'Ing.

628
41:38.320 --> 41:39.560
I need to have a word with you.

629
41:41.120 --> 41:42.320
Dammit.

630
41:45.240 --> 41:48.360
[The UNCUT version of Fool in Love]
